[?2004lmillhull   CLI, bind, drive, and ELF helpers
cuewell    weigh status
wickdesk   flame emit
offpack    checksum helper and stamp notes
spanhearth workload units and pc.lst
hearthbin  mapped ELF
wickbin    layout.qmap and flame.qprf

--- forms ---
layout.qmap
  First line: QMAP1
  Later lines: path device inode digest_hex text_vma text_off text_sz
  device and inode are decimal from the mapped file.
  digest_hex is 64 lowercase hex digits of sha256 over the file at path.
  text_vma, text_off, text_sz are decimal integers from the executable load segment.

flame.qprf
  First line: QPRF1
  Later lines: pc_hex name
  pc_hex is lowercase hex without a 0x prefix.
  name is the live symbol covering that PC in /app/hearthbin/span.elf.

pc.lst
  One lowercase hex PC per line.

load.c
  tamp compiles /app/spanhearth/load.c; /app/spanhearth/wave.txt selects the generation.
